    "detailed_description": "<strong>This is my first game. I hope you enjoy it.</strong><br><br><strong>Story:</strong><br><br>Your name is Jennifer, 24 -year old- returning home after studying abroad for a couple of years.<br><br>Eager to reconnect, you and your sister Veronica have rented a house in the woods. Veronica will be coming tomorrow morning, you arrive at night after the flight.<br><br>Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>First-person Perspective:</strong> Immerse yourself completely in the unsettling world as you explore through the eyes of the protagonist.<br></li><li><strong>Environmental Interaction:</strong> Interact with certain objects and complete basic objectives to progress the story.<br></li><li><strong>Atmospheric Graphics:</strong> Explore a place in oppressive darkness, where what you can't see is often more terrifying than what you can.</li></ul>",
